&lt;h4&gt;Job Duties and Responsibilities:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Acquire and maintain a high degree of business domain knowledge and current best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work to develop complex applications which are integrated within the constraints of the framework.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in architectural, database and user experience design for delivering client custom solutions including document output and process customisations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write, test, and maintain clean, efficient code for applications, following coding standards and best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Follow Change team processes for development lifecycle and release management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively participate in agile meetings, such as daily stand-ups, sprint planning, and sprint reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in code reviews and apply feedback to improve code quality and development practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce software documentation, including technical specifications and release documents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support testing processes and quality assurance to ensure reliable software delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot and resolve acceptance issues raised by clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and update requests in Jira with focus on clear and timely client communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with senior developers, testers, and other team members in a collaborative environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Undertake installations and upgrades of various software according to installation packs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Experience, Education and Qualifications:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in computer science, business administration, information systems or equivalent education.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of related experience with responsibilities related to Legal Technology or Professional Services products and service.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in Object-Oriented Programming.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in VB, C#, SQL, XML, XSL, Web Services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Desirable experience in integration platforms such as Logic Apps, and in REST APIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of Windows Operating System.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of agile principles and a willingness to be flexible and respond to change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of ITIL frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage workload to continually deliver excellent results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-motivation and learning drive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to communicate effectively, verbally and in writing, with technical, business and management staff.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage multiple deliverables in a fast-paced environment within a framework of constantly shifting priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent interpersonal skills with the ability to develop solid working relationships with colleagues and clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong desire to learn and grow, stay updated on industry trends, and contribute to the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;x_ContentPasted0&quot;&gt;About Us:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;x_ContentPasted0&quot;&gt;Harbor is the preeminent provider of expert services across strategy, legal technology, operations, and intelligence. Our globally integrated team of 900+ strategists, technologists, and specialists navigate alongside our clients – leading law firms, corporations, and their law departments – to provide essential resources and invaluable insights. Anchored in a rich heritage of deep knowledge, steadfast relationships, and mutual respect, our unwavering dedication lies in shaping the future of the legal industry and fostering enduring partnerships within our community and ecosystem.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;x_ContentPasted0&quot;&gt;Harbor is an equal opportunity employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, ethnicity, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, marital status, civil union status, national origin, ancestry, age, parental status, disabled status, veteran status, or any other legally protected classification, in accordance with applicable law.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Harbor Labs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a new team within Harbor focused on solving hard AI implementation problems in the legal market. We have strong hypotheses about what works, but&amp;nbsp;we&#39;re&amp;nbsp;building this like a startup: learning as we go, adjusting direction based on what the market tells us, and staying flexible about how we&amp;nbsp;operate.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We&#39;re&amp;nbsp;looking for a&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Director of AI Engagements&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;to lead our most important client relationships and&amp;nbsp;set&amp;nbsp;the strategy for how we deploy AI in production. This is a senior role for someone who can sit across the table from a GC or COO, shape the direction of an engagement, and then roll up their sleeves and build alongside the team to deliver it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;This is a leadership role, but not a hands-off one.&amp;nbsp;You&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;own the strategy for your engagements and stay close enough to the work to configure systems, pressure-test outputs, and make the calls that&amp;nbsp;determine&amp;nbsp;whether AI&amp;nbsp;actually sticks&amp;nbsp;in a&amp;nbsp;client&#39;s&amp;nbsp;day-to-day.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;What Makes This Different:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245529&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:280,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Our edge is combining deep legal domain experience with product sensibility and strong engineering. We understand how legal teams&amp;nbsp;actually work, what change management looks like in risk-averse environments, and how to build software that people will use. We also know the common pitfalls of enterprise software in traditionally low-innovation areas like law, and&amp;nbsp;we&#39;re&amp;nbsp;determined&amp;nbsp;to avoid them.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We focus on hard, novel problems where standard platforms fall short. The work is&amp;nbsp;ambiguous,&amp;nbsp;the solutions&amp;nbsp;aren&#39;t&amp;nbsp;obvious, and&amp;nbsp;that&#39;s&amp;nbsp;the point. As a senior leader here, you&amp;nbsp;set&amp;nbsp;the bar for how we approach those problems and how we show up with clients.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245529&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:280,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Own the strategy for your engagements.&amp;nbsp;Shape what success looks like with the client&#39;s leadership, define the roadmap, and make&amp;nbsp;the prioritization&amp;nbsp;calls.&amp;nbsp;You&#39;re&amp;nbsp;accountable for the outcome and the relationship, not just the deliverable.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Lead at the executive level.&amp;nbsp;Be the trusted partner to GCs, COOs, and heads of legal operations. Translate where AI is heading into a concrete plan they can get&amp;nbsp;behind, and&amp;nbsp;bring skeptics along.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Stay hands-on with the work.&amp;nbsp;Configure systems, structure knowledge sources, write and refine prompts, design test cases, and&amp;nbsp;validate&amp;nbsp;outputs against real data. You lead from inside the work, not above it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Set&amp;nbsp;direction&amp;nbsp;for delivery.&amp;nbsp;Define how an engagement is scoped, staffed, and sequenced. Work shoulder-to-shoulder with engineers and delivery leads to&amp;nbsp;turn&amp;nbsp;an ambiguous business problem into a production system.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Design the operating model, not just the workflow.&amp;nbsp;Figure out how AI changes the way a legal team&amp;nbsp;operates: the processes, the roles, the&amp;nbsp;governance.&amp;nbsp;Redesign how the work gets done, then make the change actually happen.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Drive architecture and integration decisions.&amp;nbsp;Partner with engineers on how AI fits into client tech stacks: APIs, data flows,&amp;nbsp;security&amp;nbsp;and compliance requirements. Hold the line on what&#39;s production-grade.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
