&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;You&#39;re&amp;nbsp;deeply fluent in&amp;nbsp;AI, but&amp;nbsp;not captured by hype.&amp;nbsp;You understand how these systems work in production: RAG architectures, agentic workflows, prompt engineering, evaluation methods. You know how to separate&amp;nbsp;signal&amp;nbsp;from noise when every vendor claims to be the next breakthrough.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;You hold current model-provider credentials.&amp;nbsp;Anthropic Academy certifications (AI Fluency: Framework &amp;amp; Foundations, Claude Code,&amp;nbsp;Building&amp;nbsp;with the Claude API, Model Context Protocol) are a strong plus, and current OpenAI Academy coursework counts too. We treat these as a real signal, not a checkbox: they show&amp;nbsp;you&#39;re&amp;nbsp;building with today&#39;s tools, not describing&amp;nbsp;yesterday&#39;s.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
